{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a messenger, you need to return a pack of important documents from the remote town of Turow. But once you arrive, you find out that your appearance doesn't make everyone happy back there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will have to uncover the secrets of that gloomy place and discover what happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in the atmosphere of a small town of the early 20th century. Talk to the locals, fight the enemies, explore the town and its surroundings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677910/extras/Tank.gif?t=1745413932\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dieselpunk alternate history</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stylized graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gloomy atmosphere of a faraway town</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3677910?t=1745413932","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3677910?t=1745413932","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677910/a2141d168b5a758892d542e485787b5f538bdecf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745413932","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677910/a2141d168b5a758892d542e485787b5f538bdecf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745413932","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game contains opponents that the main character can kill with bladed weapons or firearms. Also, some locations have a mysterious and gloomy atmosphere."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a messenger, you need to return a pack of important documents from th